      "section_title": "Assignment 5",
      "section_number": null,
      "teaching_text": "Assignment 5:\r\n\r\n1- Build a non-planar surface in Rhino.\r\n\r\n2- Evaluate a point onto the surface using an MD Slider.\r\n\r\n3- Divide the Surface into many points.\r\n\r\n4- Move the points in the normal direction, with vector lengths in relationship with the evaluated point from the MD Slider.\r\n\r\n5- You may need to remap the values if needed.\r\n\r\n6- Move the MD Slider and see how the normal lines change their lengths in relationship with the point.\r\n\r\nCONGRATULATIONS!\r\nYou just made your first ATTRACTOR Definition in Grasshopper!",
